<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (Suppose we are designing a College Attendance App. Instead of directly designing the screens, a UX researcher first talks to students and observes how they currently check their attendance. The research may reveal that students find it difficult to know which subjects have low attendance and often calculate the percentage manually. Based on these findings, the designer can create a dashboard showing subject-wise attendance, overall percentage, and shortage alerts.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
